  "full_response": "**[Your Full Name]**\n[Your Job Title]\n[Your Company/Organization Name]\n[Your Company Address]\n[City, State, ZIP Code]\n[Your Email Address]\n[Your Phone Number]\n[Date]\n\n**To Whom It May Concern,**\n\nI am pleased to write this letter of recommendation for **[Applicant’s Full Name]**, who has been employed at **[Current Employer’s Name]** as a **[Applicant’s Job Title]** since **[Start Date, if known]**. It has been my privilege to work closely with **[Applicant’s First Name]** during this time, and I can confidently attest to their professionalism, dedication, and outstanding work ethic.\n\n**[Applicant’s First Name]** has consistently demonstrated exceptional skills in **[mention key skills, e.g., project management, team leadership, technical expertise, communication, etc.]**. Their ability to **[describe a key achievement or responsibility, e.g., \"lead cross-functional teams to deliver complex projects on time,\" \"innovate solutions to improve operational efficiency,\" or \"provide exceptional client service\"]** has been invaluable to our organization. For example, **[provide a specific example of their work or impact, if possible]**.\n\nBeyond their technical abilities, **[Applicant’s First Name]** is a collaborative and supportive team member who fosters a positive work environment. Their strong interpersonal skills, adaptability, and problem-solving mindset make them an asset to any organization. I have no doubt that they will bring the same level of excellence and enthusiasm to their future endeavors.\n\n**[Applicant’s First Name]** is a highly motivated professional, and I am confident that they will thrive in **[mention the opportunity they are pursuing, e.g., \"their next role,\" \"this graduate program,\" \"this leadership position\"]**. I wholeheartedly recommend them without reservation and am happy to provide further information if needed.\n\nPlease feel free to contact me at **[Your Email Address]** or **[Your Phone Number]** if you require any additional details.\n\nSincerely,\n**[Your Full Name]**\n[Your Job Title]\n[Your Company/Organization Name]\n\n---\n**Applicant’s Contact Information:**\n**[Applicant’s Full Name]**\n[Applicant’s Current Job Title]\n[Current Employer’s Name]\n[Applicant’s Email Address]\n[Applicant’s Phone Number]",
